{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:35 2026-09-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:35 2026-09-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:35 2026-09-16 HKT</p><p>今晚第四場公益金盃韋廄的「烈焰光芒」上季尾由潘頓策騎勝岀此程比賽，如今人馬再跑同程，順利取得跨季連捷，並且捧盃之餘，韋達亦憑此駒開齋。</p><p>賽後韋達說：「『烈焰光芒』很享受放暑假，經過暑假休息後，雖然馬兒的心理上仍未成熟，思想稚嫩，但生理上馬匹有所成長。此馬有天生速度，排二檔有利，加上潘頓的發揮有助馬兒爭取好成績。我相信如果『烈焰光芒』心理上更為成熟，將來表現當有更上一層樓。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2d9d1ae58af7dc8b9c44bb58dfd4745b/2026-09/0dae523f-9d6b-46f6-9446-850dd2e6c719.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ba784d91fe52f341da5ca86da35a43e6/2026-09/2d6b0fb5-8852-4531-a141-714559eb3877.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d6faaf5a0ede08b7ef6ce56f9ff1c596/2026-09/4a275268-ba7c-4512-9c3f-4fd368dd2316.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/533550d8050ed729ac5f4b6cfb01f5f9/2026-09/4c1175a6-947e-4455-a9a6-262401e57dbf.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c13fc01a7a6b91bfa32613d98c6438b3/2026-09/8a953a38-6c94-4daa-a352-921f82866cd1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6a838258caa6b8404d4322c4b9b8861b/2026-09/8b4b4f65-82eb-40b2-a457-c3380262b473.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9c32b060fdd6673da019bcc2e1bae0af/2026-09/9ca738bd-39ab-4801-91a2-4398d3341dde.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/28b8ffd42a1bbc7aa710fca499b4c26d/2026-09/46b923be-e09b-4c79-875c-b82b09d89b9e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3c6753b8764181d25fbe982e91800104/2026-09/808c2daf-ceaf-49f0-9d8a-d9e9d09a1561.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c5c30f3794c8fb19fcf74188dd639e91/2026-09/3867cac8-6c33-4b7b-9466-39a49e4a8fcf.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5ed5de8d8db268b9264a7d118d97df33/2026-09/38576e7c-6d65-4467-b12b-3afe9f265dec.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8f6e9f231d6342f8d58039b1f3620e76/2026-09/708472af-d474-4b71-b470